        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***PHOTOS AND VIDEO TO FOLLOW***\r\n\r\nLWK are delighted to present this exceptional property to the market. A beautifully maintained third floor, one bedroom apartment, 23 Canon Court offers a bright, welcoming home in the heart of Dublin 8. Presented in excellent condition, the property combines comfort, practicality, and security, further enhanced by the rare benefit of a secure underground car park.\r\n\r\nThe apartment opens into a warm, inviting entrance hallway, thoughtfully designed with storage to keep everyday living organised. A fully fitted kitchen provides modern appliances and generous workspace. The bright, spacious living/dining room enjoys abundant natural light, creating an airy, relaxing environment perfect for unwinding or hosting friends. The large double bedroom continues the theme of comfort, offering ample built in wardrobes and a calm atmosphere for restful nights. The property is completed by a fully fitted bathroom.The development enjoysa roof top communal garden overlooking St Patricks park.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptional. Canon Court sits right beside the iconic Saint Patrick’s Cathedral, placing one of Ireland’s most treasured landmarks quite literally on your doorstep. A short stroll brings you to St Stephen’s Green, offering leafy parkland, boutique shopping, and the vibrant energy of Grafton Street. Dublin 8 itself is rich with cafés, artisan bakeries, neighbourhood restaurants, and independent shops, while cultural highlights such as the Guinness Storehouse and Christ Church Cathedral, are all within easy reach. Excellent transport links—including Dublin Bus routes, the Luas, and convenient walking access to the city centre—make commuting effortless.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
